        "narrationCoverOpacity": 0,
        "narrationEffect": "in",
        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
        "narrationPosX": 150,
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:无可言表的黑暗感情]@[textBlack:满溢于我的身体之中。]",
        "turnChangeOut": "fadeOut",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-1"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:拜此所赐，脑内就像起雾了一样]@[textBlack:仍然无法正常思考。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-2"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:究其起因，都是我的不好。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-3"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:明明理解了自己的心情，]@[textBlack:却不去接纳它，]@[textBlack:甚至撇开视线，从现实中逃避了出来…]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-4"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:…回想起来，事情的开端是比现在稍早的时候。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-5"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:那是在伊吕波小姐她们救回了小忧，]@[textBlack:PROMISED BLOOD的各位]@[textBlack:入手了两块[textYellow:心魔]石的时候的事情。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-6"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:那个时候，]@[textBlack:我正借助着小灯花和小音梦的力量，]@[textBlack:试着把自己整理出来的东西和令同学的照片]@[textBlack:一起发送出去。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-7"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:残留下的[textYellow:心魔]石变得只剩两块，]@[textBlack:我有了争夺即将开始的预感，]@[textBlack:同时压抑着自己焦躁的内心…]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-8"
      },
      {
        "autoTurnLast": 0.5,
        "bg": "bg_adv_21132.jpg",
        "chara": [
          {
            "cheek": 0,
            "eyeClose": 1,
