        "turnEffect": "stop"
      },
      {
        "nameNarration": "笼目",
        "narrationCoverOpacity": 0,
        "narrationEffect": "in",
        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
        "narrationPosX": 150,
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:真想对那时候的我大声呵斥，]@[textBlack:『现在不是该害怕的时候！』]@[textBlack:想要告诫那时的自己，难道不应该为了]@[textBlack:不让不想看见的状况成为现实，好好努力吗…]",
        "turnChangeOut": "fadeOut",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-16"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:但是，我也明白事到如今就算后悔也没用了，]@[textBlack:而且比起一直郁闷着，]@[textBlack:还不如反省一下过去的做法…]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-17"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:所以，现在暂且回溯一下吧。]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-18"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:回到那个伊吕波小姐她们行动起来，]@[textBlack:令小姐和阿莉娜小姐她们行动起来，]@[textBlack:红晴小姐她们行动起来，]@[textBlack:静香小姐她们行动起来，]@[textBlack:姬奈小姐她们也行动起来了的时候…]",
        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102501/vo_full_102501-1-19"
      },
      {
        "progressNarration": "[textBlack:回到那个已经回不去了的时间…]",
